    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 89035,
        "name": {
          "full": "Reina Izumi",
          "native": "和泉玲奈",
          "alternative": [
            "The Phantom Eater"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89035-51jssFRh0fgB.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 157 cm (5'2\")\n__Affiliations:__ Hosea Academy, Team E\n__Occupation:__ First year High School Student. Ability Wielder, Phantom Hunter\n\nReina Izumi is a first-year high school student who transferred to Hosea Academy in April. She has a special ability, and because of this she later joins the Phantom-Hunter club with [Haruhiko Ichijou](https://anilist.co/character/89033/Haruhiko-Ichijou) as a member of Team E. She does not get along well with her parents until some events that happen later.\n\nReina has a special ability to consume and seal away phantoms, hence why she was given the nickname ‘The Phantom Eater.’ This ability also satisfies her hunger. However, if she doesn’t want to eat the phantom then she won’t. She notably doesn’t require an incantation to use her ability, unlike her other teammates in Team E. Other than her sealing ability, she also has the ability to heal through mouth contact. As a practitioner of Aikido, Reina knows basic self-defense where she can easily throw people taller than her (like Haruhiko).",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "15"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 95869,
          "name": {
            "full": "Saori Hayami",
            "native": "早見沙織"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95869-qCQ0EaWpq1QT.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 89036,
        "name": {
          "full": "Koito Minase",
          "native": "水無瀬小糸",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89036-BIIEqhfriIcm.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 162 cm (5'4\")\n__Affiliations:__ Hosea Academy, Team E\n__Occupation:__ 1st-year High School Student, Ability Wielder, Phantom Hunter\n\nKoito Minase is a 1st-year high school student who transferred to Hosea Academy in April. Initially, instead of joining a club or fighting the phantoms together with the others, she chose to fight them alone. This is due to the fact that she has shut herself off from other people because of an incident that happened during her childhood. After Team E helped her on various occasions, despite wishing to work on her own, she decides to join them as an official member of the club.\n\nIn order to fight, Koito has a special ability that she commands with her voice. By using an incantation, she can create bindings that can capture, immobilize, and even destroy phantoms if she so chooses to.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "16"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
