        "description": "__Height:__ 132cm (4'4\")\n__Affiliations:__ Hosea Academy, Team E\n__Occupation:__ 4th-year Grade School Student, Ability Wielder, Phantom Hunter\n\nKurumi Kumamakura is a 4th-year grade school student at Hosea Academy. After getting to know [Haruhiko Ichijou](https://anilist.co/character/89033/Haruhiko-Ichijou), she joins Team E as a member of the Phantom-Hunter club.\n\nIn order to fight, she uses her special ability, Albrecht, a teddy bear in which she always carries around her wherever she goes. If she could, Kurumi would put her life on the line if it meant protecting him, as she considers him to be her childhood best friend (even if he doesn't talk). In fact, she loves everything that has to do with bears, from the animal itself, her favorite food, her birth place, and her last name which has \"Kuma\" (Bear) in it's name.",
